941735_2272622210460028300_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nTj-rAzfo0MQ7kNvwHLVbIE&_nc_oc=AdpqJ5HMduu7KO0q83rL99qjsE_gvaBi5rl4buvWDwmEuy3MQJF8F5zPcB69OgxonYs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRxyB4hSU3-EhmLANlVaPBiPwv6k0SdIfj1yd7eKO141Q&oe=6B030730"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "GalacticCorridor_Cover_Landscape_2560x1440.png", "id": "4627193387562551", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823259_4627193390895884_5312934501684470882_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YriSnx04t3oQ7kNvwFBvwkq&_nc_oc=AdqSKw1VSBFfHFV7mLYkm1x91TkspL1F7bwzqpfHbuEYJMmhexSb28SKVX0LFGQJj-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTg6OHIKAorCZMfS7bvmKxU1B7t9dwN1qxFghzGnrwpDA&oe=6B03383B"}, "display_name": "Galactic Corridor", "keywords": ["Game", "Space", "SpaceShip", "Shooter", "Alien"], "long_description": "Galactic Corridor takes you on an exhilarating journey through the farthest corners of space. As a skilled pilot, you\u2019ll navigate your advanced spacecraft through treacherous corridors, seeking out high-value targets across the galaxy. Equipped with powerful weapons and shields, your mission is clear: hunt down your enemies and obliterate them before they can strike back.\n\nThe game combines fast-paced space battles with strategic planning, as you carefully aim, dodge incoming fire, and track down targets in complex space environments. Each mission brings a new challenge, with diverse settings ranging from asteroid fields to alien-infested zones. Upgrade your ship, unlock new weapons, and become a legendary force in the universe. In Galactic Corridor, it\u2019s not just about survival\u2014it\u2019s about domination. Get ready to conquer the galaxy and prove you're the top dog in space!", "short_description": "Galactic Corridor is an intense space combat game where you navigate th